    <header><h1 id="title">Spec for Specs</h1><p id="last-modified"><time datetime="2023-03-14T00:00:00.000Z">14 March 2023</time></p><div class="ipseity-maturity"><img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/status-stable-brightgreen.svg?style=flat-square" height="20" alt="status: stable"></div><dl><dt>History</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/ipfs/specs/commits/main/src/meta/spec-for-specs.md">Commit History</a></dd><dt>Feedback</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/ipfs/specs">GitHub ipfs/specs</a><span> (</span><a href="https://github.com/ipfs/specs/blob/main/src/meta/spec-for-specs.md">inspect source</a><span>, </span><a href="https://github.com/ipfs/specs/issues/new/choose">open issue</a><span>)</span></dd></dl><div id="abstract"><p>This document specifies the format and system used to create and maintain specifications for
